---
---

<section id="biomes" class="features-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="badge">Dynamic World Progression</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">EXPLORE 7 <span class="gradient-text">TIME EPOCHS</span></h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Experience dynamic environment transitions, unique hazards, and changing gravity as you survive longer!</p>
    </div>

    <div class="biomes-grid">
      <a href="/epochs#jurassic" class="biome-card jurassic">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌴</div>
        <h3>Jurassic Dawn</h3>
        <p>Lush prehistoric jungles filled with soaring pterodactyls, rolling boulders, and ancient palm trees.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#volcano" class="biome-card volcano">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌋</div>
        <h3>Volcanic Wasteland</h3>
        <p>Survive active lava pits with music equalizer spout eruptions and falling fiery meteorites.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#ice" class="biome-card ice">
        <div class="biome-icon">❄️</div>
        <h3>Ice Age Glaciers</h3>
        <p>Cross frozen glaciers under glowing Northern Lights (Aurora Borealis) and swirling snowstorms.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#desert" class="biome-card desert">
        <div class="biome-icon">🏜️</div>
        <h3>Sandstone Desert</h3>
        <p>Run past ancient Egyptian Pyramids under golden sunbeams, heat hazes, and rolling tumbleweeds.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#forest" class="biome-card forest">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌲</div>
        <h3>Enchanted Spore Forest</h3>
        <p>Misty woods filled with glowing pollen spores, giant mushrooms, and mossy crags.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#cyberpunk" class="biome-card cyberpunk">
        <div class="biome-icon">🏙️</div>
        <h3>Cyberpunk Metropolis</h3>
        <p>Futuristic neon skyline with holographic billboards, digital glitch surges, and synthwave vibes.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>

      <a href="/epochs#cosmos" class="biome-card space">
        <div class="biome-icon">🚀</div>
        <h3>Cosmos Zero-G</h3>
        <p>Blast into deep space! Dodge falling meteor showers, float with zero gravity, and catch coin rain.</p>
        <span class="explore-link">Explore Era & Hazards →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="biomes-footer-cta">
      <a href="/epochs" class="btn-secondary">📖 Read Complete Biomes & Lore Encyclopedia</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-card);
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 5px 12px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.25);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .biomes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .biome-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 28px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  .biome-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .biome-icon {
    font-size: 38px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .biome-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .biome-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .explore-link {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .biome-card:hover .explore-link {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .biomes-footer-cta {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .btn-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 12px 28px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.15);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }
</style>
